      "body": "Ninety samples by thirty features, z-scored per feature, with rows and columns reordered by hierarchical clustering and dendrograms on both axes; the strip names each sample's condition. Normalisation and the clustering method are in the tile header, and filtering to one condition recomputes the tree. Input: a normalised count matrix such as nf- core/rnaseq or nf-core/differentialabundance produce.\n",
